## Task: Write deterministic integration test for per-charter auto-gate

**Role:** qa-engineer
**Files:** `reference/tests/per-charter-auto-gate.test.sh` (new), `reference/runtime/per-leaf-manifest`, `reference/tests/leaf-verifier.test.sh`

### Background

Charter #401 adds per-charter labels `auto:plan-approve` and `auto:merge` that OR with global env flags to control gate progression. This leaf adds a deterministic integration test covering all four acceptance paths, updates the per-leaf-manifest inventory, and keeps leaf-verifier.test.sh Test 7 consistent.

Follow the plan-convergence.test.sh stub-agent pattern: real launcher binary, file-based board, stub gh binary that records calls. The test runner must exit with failed=0.

